theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 15
text = "FLIGHT TEST  (keyboard + mouse  |  gamepad)

Fly: WASD or arrows  |  left stick
Aim: mouse  |  right stick
Fire: left click  |  RT
Brake: Ctrl  |  LT
Boost (hold): Shift  |  A
Drift (hold): Space  |  B or LB
Restart: R  |  Start
Hide this: F1  |  Back

Hold drift while turning to slide. Sparks
turn blue, then orange: let go for a speed
kick and some boost fuel back.
Boost into a target to ram it."
